Z||000000||Formula||11-03-2000||05:09 PM||||background: I go to penn-state fayette. I have to commute to campus 4 days a week, its about 40 minutes to get there. So I drive about 80 miles a day and average around 15-20 mpg.  And I work in Morgantown WV, which is about 25 miles away and thats about a 50 minute drive on wekkends. So Im driving about 420 miles a week.<P>Work: I make $7.75 an hour and work 11 hours a week in Morgantown (only on weekends during school). Thats about $140 every 2 weeks and it pays for my gas, and I have enough money left to go out with some friends or a girl or do something on saturday night.  <P>Stupid people:  My friend works at BP.  They are in desperate need of people, so I offer to work there, maybe a night shift on fridays or saturdays and he told the manager and I got hired instantly.  So I tell the manager that I have to put my 2 week notice in at morgantown and I tell her a I cant work monday nights because I have late classes.  btw, BP is only 2 miles from my house, so it would save me a lot of miles and give the fiero a rest sometimes.<P>Today:  I drive all the way to morgantown from uniontown and put in my 2 week notice.  The supervisor says that shes sorry to see me go and I can always come back to work here because I've been here so long blah blah blah...  It actually made me feel bad.<P>So I go into BP to get my schedule for next week and its ALL screwed up, she scheduled me to work on MONDAY night (I told her 50 times I have classes) and she scheduled me to work all night saturday night.....I told her until my 2 week notice is up I can only work afternoons, so that I dont have to work all night at BP and go to morgantown and work the whole next morning.  she at least got friday afternnon right  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Now:  the situation is; is it worth leaving my job where Im respected and they really appreciate me working there to work for someplace that completly screwed up in the first week?  Im half tempted to go in there and *****  her out about this because I was doing THEM a favor by helping out because they really needed it.  I know it helps me out too to work there but I was taking a $1.10 pay cut to keep the miles down on my fiero and keep it from breaking so many damn parts.  But this is really aggravating me that my schedule is screwed up, and I havent even started there.  Im going to go in tomorrow and if they dont change my schedule Im not going to work for them.  But if they do change it I dont now where I should work.<P>what would you do?  <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FormulaSignature2.jpg"> ||||reg||1
